<title>UK: Tuapse pipeline closed till late Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Tuapse pipeline closed till late Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The crude pipeline running to the oil base at the Russian Black Sea port of Tuapse will be closed until 2000 GMT on Wednesday, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>No reason was given for the closure and it was not clear when the pipeline closed.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
